      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "33403001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "主君，这间屋子！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "33403003",
              "text": "喜欢吗？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "33403003",
              "text": "不喜欢吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "33403002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33403003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "我当然是喜欢的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33403004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "这屋檐，这书案，这香炉……这我梦想中的屋子就是这样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33403005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "无数个夜晚，我期待着能和知己在这屋子里抚琴谈心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33403006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "我从未和别人说过的它的样子，但现在，它居然真的出现在我眼前。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33403007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这就是我们的默契。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33403008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "谢谢你，主君，我的知己……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33403009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "与你相遇之后，那些遥不可及的梦想，全都变成了真实的幸福。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33403010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不论是什么梦想，我们都会一起实现。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33403011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "君子一言，千金不换，我会永远记住这个约定。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33403012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蔡文姬",
          "text": "而现在，|101|，闭上眼睛，细细倾听吧。这首为你而作的歌。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "33403",
